- @convince_spd_dvp_candidate: Convince the SPD to back [+ dvp_candidate +].
- @convince_csvd_dvp_candidate: Convince the CSVD to back [+ dvp_candidate +].
- @convince_csrp_dvp_candidate: Convince the CSRP to back [+ dvp_candidate +].
- @convince_wp_dvp_candidate: Convince the WP to back [+ dvp_candidate +].
