@convince_z_dvp_candidate
view-if: z_candidate != dvp_candidate
go-to: convince_z_success_dvp_candidate if z_relation >= 40; convince_z_fail_dvp_candidate if z_relation < 40
max-visits: 1

We try to convince the Center Party to support [+ dvp_candidate +].

@convince_z_success_dvp_candidate
on-arrival: z_relation += 3; z_candidate = dvp_candidate; braun_votes -= (z_normalized - bvp_votes) if z_candidate = "Braun"; bvp_candidate = dvp_candidate if z_relation >= 50
go-to: endorsements_dvp_candidate

Thanks to our friendly relations and connections with their right wing, the Center Party is now campaigning for [+ dvp_candidate +] in the election. [? if bvp_candidate = dvp_candidate: BVP will also support our candidate. ?]

@convince_z_fail_dvp_candidate
on-arrival: z_relation -= 3
go-to: endorsements_dvp_candidate

Unfortunately, the Center Party has refused to support [+ dvp_candidate +] for the presidency.


@convince_dbp_dvp_candidate
view-if: dbp_exist and dbp_candidate != dvp_candidate
go-to: convince_dbp_success_dvp_candidate if dbp_relation >= 40; convince_dbp_fail_dvp_candidate if dbp_relation < 40
