We try to convince the DBP to support [+ dvp_candidate +].

@convince_dbp_success_dvp_candidate
on-arrival: dbp_relation += 3; dbp_candidate = dvp_candidate; braun_votes -= dbp_normalized if dbp_candidate = "Braun"
