@support_braun
subtitle: This is the default option.
view-if: braun_campaign
on-arrival: industrialist_dissent += 15; nationalist_dissent += 30; dvp_candidate = "Braun"

We will support Braun in this election.

- @endorsements_braun: Scout out potential endorsements.

@endorsements_braun

We can try to convince parties supporting other candidates to switch their support to Braun.

- @convince_z_braun: Convince the Center Party to back Braun.
- @convince_ddp_braun: Convince the [+ ddp_name +] to back Braun.
- @convince_dbp_braun: Convince the DBP to back Braun.
- @view_candidates: View party endorsements.
- @hope: We have concluded negotiations with other parties.

@convince_z_braun
view-if: z_candidate != "Braun"
go-to: convince_z_success_braun if ((z_relation >= 40 and not z_leader = "Kaas") or (z_relation >= 60 and z_leader = "Kaas")); convince_z_fail_braun if not ((z_relation >= 40 and not z_leader = "Kaas") or (z_relation >= 60 and z_leader = "Kaas"))
max-visits: 1

We try to convince the Center Party to support Braun.

@convince_z_success_braun
